### 4. Reproduce Table 6 (Llama amp1/amp2/amp3/amp4 sweep)

The (S, M) grid is:

| Script | S    | M | Notes                                |
|--------|------|---|--------------------------------------|
| amp1   | 1024 | 4 | moderate context, low M              |
| amp2   | 2048 | 4 | default headline (e2e Table 3 ref)   |
