| Script | (S, M)      | per_mb baseline | strat-enum bundled | Headline speedup |
|--------|-------------|----------------:|-------------------:|-----------------:|
| amp1   | (1024, 4)   |        46.26 ms |          12.68 ms |        **3.65×** |
| amp2   | (2048, 4)   |        60.08 ms |          17.14 ms |        **3.51×** |
| amp3   | (1024, 8)   |        90.62 ms |          15.43 ms |        **5.87×** |
