**Per-primitive per-step speedups** (from split fsdp+tp_mlp probes,
amp1 strat-enum): fsdp_prefetch 4.02×, tp_mlp 3.83×, pp_send_recv 6.38×,
vocab_dxe 3.80×. All per-primitive per-step ratios consistently exceed
the e2e headline (3.62×) because constant non-collective compute
(FFN matmul, attention) dilutes the ratio. The M=8 scripts show ~2×
larger ratios than M=4 (~6× vs ~3.5×) from 8:1 vs 4:1 dispatch count
